        "Content": "STUNNING 6 BEDROOM RESIDENCE \r\n\r\n-  Elevated Site Overlooking Shannon Estuary   \r\n-  3 Storeys over Basement\t\r\n-  Finished to Highest Standards \r\n-  Stone Fronted \r\n-  12 Kilometres from Limerick City  \r\n-  Large Underground Store/Car Park 400m² \r\n-  Large Viewing Balcony \r\n-  Concrete Floors Throughout  \r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t10m x 4.5m    Marble tiles, Feature Staircase, Double Doors,  Ornate Cornicing \r\nSnooker Room        8m x 5m  \tSolid Wood Floor                                                                     \r\nBar Area  \t\t6m x 5m         Fully Fitted Bar, Solid Wood Floor\t\t\t\t\r\nBedroom (1)    \t6.3m x 4m      Ensuite, Carpet\r\nBedroom (2)    \t5m x 5m         Ensuite, Wood Floor\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\nLaundry Room & W.C.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding Area\t\tFully Tiled  \r\nLivingroom    \t\t9m x 5m\tSolid Wood Floor, Feature Fireplace, 2 No. Balconies      \r\nMaster Bedroom     8m x 5m\tEnsuite, Fitted Wardrobe \r\nKitchen/ Living/Dining11m x 4m    Quality Cabinetry, Central Island, Stone Worktops,Cornicing.\t\r\nBedroom (4) \t\t\t6m x 5m         Ensuite\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\nBathroom\t\t\t3.5m x 3m\tFully Tiled  \r\nBedroom (5)    \t\t6m x 5.4m\tFitted Wardrobe, Wood Floor   \r\nBedroom (6)    \t\t6.6m x 6m\tFitted Wardrobe, Wood Floor       \r\n\r\nUnderground Store\r\nElectric Rolling Doors, 400m², Ideal for variety of uses.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nCut stone entrance, Electric gates, Winding Driveway, Dry Garden to Front, Car Parking Bay to rear,\r\nRear Lawn.\r\n\r\nFeatures: Underfloor heating via heat pump, 3 floors over basement, Stunning Views of Estuary, High Level of Finish, uPvc Windows, high level of insulation, Solar Panels \r\n\r\nTo Be Noted\r\nThese Particulars are given on the strict understanding that they will not form part of any contract. Whilst every care has been taken in preparing these particulars; no responsibility is taken for any inaccuracies or errors. In the event of any inconsistency between these particulars and the contract of sale, the latter shall prevail. These details do not form part of any contract and are issued on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through the agents."
